  "query_preview": "/Wednesday through Sunday/...\nHot and dry conditions are forecast to continue developing as \nthe Desert Southwest ridge builds northward over the area. This \nwill bring a return to above normal temperatures starting \nWednesday and continuing through the weekend. Without smoke, \nthis will put lower elevations in the mid-upper 90s, however \nwest- northwest flow aloft and light winds near the surface \nwould be favorable for smoke to collect from nearby fires. \nSimilar to this last week, the tradeoff for not quite as hot in \nthe extended period will be due to greater smoke \ncoverage/density.",
